{"title":"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">2024 CEMC Fermat #4</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">2024 CEMC Pascal #7</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Shuxin begins with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> red candies, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> yellow candies, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> blue candies. After eating some of the candies, there are equal numbers of red, yellow, and blue candies remaining. What is the smallest possible number of candies that Shuxin ate?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/3/1a3834adb493b6fd839833bb29354061710557b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 11 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 17 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 20 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since he began with less blue candies than with yellow candies and red candies, we can minimize the number of candies that he ate by having him only eat yellow and red candies until he has the same number of candies for all three colors of candies.\n</p><p>For him to end up with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> yellow candies, he would have had to eat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/6/6d67236c14b2dbe3e2494c79fc11aaf16e070079.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 - 3 = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> yellow candies.\n</p><p>For him to end up with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> red candies, he would have had to eat <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/2/7a2d2c41e900e52d3bf67b06362243964b7aec17.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10 - 3 = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> red candies.\n</p><p>This means that he ate at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/1/0a1f4ad55689dfd2fb18ce7becd71b680227a6ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 7 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"132\" height=\"30\" /> candies.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_in_Pascal_Contest\">Problem in Pascal Contest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem in Pascal Contest\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The problem is the same, except the order of the answer choices is different:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/5/0a538499f9ce703209d01e1a8c4d7f460cc84118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 17 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 11 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 20 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> was the answer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/3/8e32528b21ccaf33442b09c2a5916b3289d331aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(C) } 11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"30\" /> would be chosen.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal (page does not exist)\">2024 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_C